          "name": "Atopos punctata Collinge, 1902",
          "rank": "SPECIES",
          "commonName": "",
          "lineage": "Atopos",
          "subspeciesCount": 0,
          "description": "<p>Collinge (1902) original descriptions on <em>Atopos punctata</em> – “Colour of notum, yellow spotted with dark blue or black, granulated head and tentacles yellowish; underside (Perinotum?) yellow; foot-sole yellow with closely set transverse wrinkles; keel fairly prominent.”</p>",
