          "id": "SP_ATOPOS_TOURANNENSIS",
          "name": "Atopos tourannensis",
          "rank": "SPECIES",
          "commonName": "",
          "lineage": "Atopos",
          "subspeciesCount": 0,
          "description": "<p>Eydoux & Souleyet (1852) original descriptions on <em>Vaginulus tourannensis</em> – “<em>Vaginulus, corpore elongato, triquetro, cinticè angusto, posticè acuminato, granosa, suprà nigricante et fasciâ fulvâ nigro-maculatâ marginato, subtùs flavescente</em>.”</p> <p>Collinge (1902) original descriptions on <em>Atopos harmeri</em> – “Colour of notum, light blue with darker blue blotches and spots, a dark blue exten is along the mid-dorsal line, granulated; head yellow; tentacles dark blue; underside (Perinotum?) yellow; foot-sole only very feeble developed.”</p>",
          "sourcedFrom": "gbif",
          "wikipediaTitle": "gbif:9884211",
